#basePath Chapter12

::OnContractSelectOpenCh12
@trigger 
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Player}   Well, that could've gone better.
{@Player}   Dorian's after Keela, Frontier's after my ship...
{@Player}   One more contract and I think I can be done with these guys.


::BeforeSupplyChain12

@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Quinn}   Hey, Cowboy. Heads up. Frontier's got security checkpoints all over the shipping lanes.
{@Quinn}	It's the real wild west out here. 
{@Player}   Dorian's looking for Keela.
{@Quinn}   Well, he's stopping just about everybody in the process.
{@Player}   Any way around them?
{@Quinn}   You're gonna have to choose your routes carefully.
{@Player}   Great. He's not making this easy on me. 
    


::AfterSupplyChain12
@trigger OnOverarchingLoaded
@when   IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once

// Incoming call from Callie

{@Callie}   Hey, Clacky! Heard you've been giving the big boss trouble!
{@Player}   Callie? Where are you?
{@Callie}   Somewhere he can't find us!
{@Caliie}   <i>Callie, is that Locke?</i>
{@Player}   Keela?! You're with Callie?
{@Keela}   Hey bro! 
{@Keela}	She's a little wild. I'm more of a planner.
{@Player}   I've been trying to reach you...
{@Player}	... for months.
{@Keela}   I know. Sorry. I've been on the run.
{@Keela}   Wasn't sure where you stood with... in the middle of all this.
{@Player}   Yeah. I've just been trying to get my ship back but...
//interuption
{@Callie}	Sorry Clacky, we have to ru...
//end call

::AfterFabrication12 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once


// After final contract is paid

{@Player}   That's it! I've got enough to pay off Frontier!

//show money clearing and debt marker disappearing

{@Player}   	<i>gulp</i>. And now I'm broke.
{@Player}   But no one can take the Constantine from me!
{@Player}   Except for pirates... bad luck, and who knows.
{@Player}   I'm calling Arken. Let's see if we can get what's left of our old crew back together.
